# [OAUTH](../wg/oauth.html)

## Summary

The OAUTH Working Group met to discuss updates on active working group drafts, recent RFC publications, and proposals related to core OAuth specifications, metadata, delegation, deferred responses, and AI agent authentication. Key topics included closing remaining open issues on OAuth 2.1 towards Working Group Last Call (WGLC), deployment experience and metadata fetching constraints for Client ID Metadata Documents, key-binding and gateway extensions for Identity Assertion JWT Authorization Grants, updates to Delegate SD-JWT, integration of interactive response modes into Deferred Token Response, and proposed approaches for AI agent authentication and commerce.

